  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following two statements <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />\r<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />\r<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cosec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br />\rThen, which of the following is true?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Both <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> are true",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>P</mi></math> is true, but <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is false",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>P</mi></math> is false, but <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is true",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Both <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> are false",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have, <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Therefore,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi></math> is false.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br />Therefore,&nbsp;<math><mi>Q</mi></math> is&nbsp;true.</p>"
  }
